@startuml 04-booking-state
' DIA-004 — booking_status lifecycle (schema.ts bookingStatus enum + scheduler.service).
title Booking status lifecycle (booking_status enum)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : create booking\n(FIRST_TRIAL / SINGLE_SESSION /\nCOURSE_PACKAGE / VOUCHER)

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : staff confirm\n(idempotent + enqueue LINE to teacher)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancel

CONFIRMED --> ATTENDED : check-in (QR/LINE)\n+ award CRM points\n(planned: debit wallet)
CONFIRMED --> SICK_LEAVE : report leave
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel
CONFIRMED --> PENDING_RESCHEDULE : overbooked by\nincoming booking

SICK_LEAVE --> EXTENDED : within leave quota\nauto-append later week
SICK_LEAVE --> [*] : over quota -> Policy Lock\n(admin unlock required)

PENDING_RESCHEDULE --> CONFIRMED : parent accepts move\n(slot swapped)
PENDING_RESCHEDULE --> CANCELLED : parent rejects\n(incoming removed)

EXTENDED --> ATTENDED
EXTENDED --> SICK_LEAVE

ATTENDED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of PENDING_RESCHEDULE
  Releases its teacher slot so the
  incoming (pendingSlot=true) booking
  can hold it during conflict resolution.
end note
@enduml
